e milk in infants under 6 months. </span></span><em><span><span>Southeast Asian Journal of Tropical Medicine and Public Health</span></span></em><span><span>, 30(4), 770–775.</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>Eglash, A., &amp; Simon, L. (2017). ABM Clinical Protoco</span></span><span><span><span><span>l </span><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/hashtags/8" target="_blank"><span>#8</span></a><span>
</span></span></span></span><span><span>: Human milk storage information for home use. </span></span><em><span><span>Breastfeeding Medicine</span></span></em><span><span>, 12(7), 390–395.</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). (2023). </span></span><em><span><span>Handling Infant Formula Safely</span></span></em><span><span>. U.S. Department of Health and Human Service</span></span><span>s.</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span><span>Martysiak-Żurowska, D., Kiełbratowska, B., Sinkiewicz-Darol, E., &amp; Łubiech, K. (2026). </span></span></strong><em><span><span>Effect of microwaves HTST pasteurization on human milk components.</span></span></em><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span><span>Journal of Dairy Research.</span></span></strong></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list"></div><div></div></div><div type="last"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer><div><div><section><p>Mots-clés :</p><nav><ul><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/biberon" rel="noopener noreferrer">biberon</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/salive" rel="noopener noreferrer">salive</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/conservation" rel="noopener noreferrer">conservation</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/jeter-le-lait" rel="noopener noreferrer">jeter le lait</a></li></ul></nav></section><section><ul><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/categories/augmenter-la-lactation">Augmenter la lactation</a></li></ul></section><section><div><div><div><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19"><path d="M8.08865986,17 L8.08865986,10.2073504 L5.7890625,10.2073504 L5.7890625,7.42194226 L8.08865986,7.42194226 L8.08865986,5.08269399 C8.08865986,3.38142605 9.46779813,2.00228778 11.1690661,2.00228778 L13.5731201,2.00228778 L13.5731201,4.50700008 L11.8528988,4.50700008 C11.3123209,4.50700008 10.