</span></span><br></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span><span>Wambach, K., &amp; Spencer, B.</span></span></strong><span><span>&nbsp;(2008). </span></span><em><span><span>Breastfeeding and Human Lactation</span></span></em><span><span>. Jones &amp; Bartlett Learning</span></span><span>
</span></span><br></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span><span>Foxman, B., D''Arcy, H., Gillespie, B., Bobo, J.K., &amp; Schwartz, K.</span></span></strong><span><span>&nbsp;(2002). </span></span><em><span><span>Incidence and risk factors for lactational mastitis: a cohort study</span></span></em><span><span>. Epidemiology, 13(2), 222–231.</span></span><span>
