utton></div><div><div><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19"><path d="M10.6000004,11.7622375 L14.2108923,11.7622375 C15.4561791,11.7622375 16.4656836,10.7527331 16.4656836,9.50744629 L16.4656836,9.50744629 L16.4656836,9.50744629 C16.4656836,8.26215946 15.4561791,7.25265503 14.2108923,7.25265503 L10.6000004,7.25265503 L10.6000004,5.84470702 L10.6000004,5.84470702 C10.6000004,5.73425007 10.6895434,5.64470702 10.8000004,5.64470702 L14.3209766,5.64470702 C16.4501961,5.64470702 18.1762695,7.37078048 18.1762695,9.5 C18.1762695,11.6292195 16.4501961,13.355293 14.3209766,13.355293 L10.8000004,13.355293 L10.8000004,13.355293 C10.6895434,13.355293 10.6000004,13.2657499 10.6000004,13.155293 L10.6000004,11.7622375 Z M8.39999962,7.25265503 L4.82047474,7.25265503 C3.57518792,7.25265503 2.56568348,8.26215946 2.56568348,9.50744629 L2.56568348,9.50744629 L2.56568348,9.50744629 C2.56568348,10.7527331 3.57518792,11.7622375 4.82047474,11.7622375 L8.39999962,11.7622375 L8.39999962,13.1578418 C8.39999962,13.2682987 8.31045657,13.3578418 8.19999962,13.3578418 L4.60784179,13.3578418 C2.4772146,13.3578418 0.75,11.6306272 0.75,9.5 C0.75,7.36937281 2.4772146,5.64215821 4.60784179,5.64215821 L8.19999962,5.64215821 L8.19999962,5.64215821 C8.31045657,5.64215821 8.39999962,5.73170126 8.39999962,5.84215821 L8.39999962,7.25265503 Z M6.66568358,8.69999981 L12.2656836,8.69999981 C12.3761405,8.69999981 12.4656836,8.78954286 12.4656836,8.89999981 L12.4656836,10.1499998 C12.4656836,10.2604567 12.3761405,10.3499998 12.2656836,10.3499998 L6.66568358,10.3499998 C6.55522663,10.3499998 6.46568358,10.2604567 6.46568358,10.1499998 L6.46568358,8.89999981 C6.46568358,8.78954286 6.55522663,8.69999981 6.66568358,8.69999981 Z" transform="rotate(-45 9.463 9.5)"></path></svg><span></span></button></div></div><div><button><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18 9H19C19.552