</span></span><em><span><span>Pediatrics.</span></span></em><span><span>&nbsp;2006 Mar;117(3):e387-95.</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span><span>American Academy of Pediatrics. (2014)</span></span></strong><span><span>. </span></span><em><span><span>Failure to Thrive</span></span></em><span><span>. </span></span><em><span><span>Pediatrics in Review</span></span></em><span><span>, 35(12), 554–565.</span></span></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list"></div><div><div><span><br></span></div></div><div type="empty-line"></div><div><div><div><div><iframe title="remote content" allow="fullscreen; autoplay; encrypted-media" allowfullscreen="" src="https://c8e39045-30eb-4cb6-b302-90fd21cf6751.usrfiles.com/html/2b2e4b_d767b483cae16e027c4ea8ac7906fbf4.html"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div type="html"></div><div><div><span><br></span></div></div><div type="empty-line"></div><div><div><span><br></span></div></div><div type="empty-line"></div><div><div><span><br></span></div></div><div type="empty-line"></div></div><div type="last"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer><div><div><section><p>Mots-clés :</p><nav><ul><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/allaitement-maternel" rel="noopener noreferrer">allaitement maternel</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/consultante-en-lactation" rel="noopener noreferrer">consultante en lactation</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/biberon" rel="noopener noreferrer">biberon</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/épuisement" rel="noopener noreferrer">épuisement</a></li><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/tags/poids" rel="noopener noreferrer">poids</a></li></ul></nav></section><section><ul><li><a href="https://www.caroleherve.fr/blog/categories/augmenter-la-lactation">Augmenter la lactation</a></li></ul></section><section><div><div><div><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19"><path d="M8.08865986,17 L8.08865986,10.2073504 L5.7890625,10.2073504 L5.7890625,7.42194226 L8.08865986,7.42194226 L8.08865986,5.08269399 C8.08865986,3.38142605 9.46779813,2.00228778 11.1690661,2.00228778 L13.5731201,2.00228778 L13.5731201,4.50700008 L11.8528988,4.50700008 C11.3123209,4.50700008 10.874068,4.94525303 10.874068,5.48583089 L10.874068,7.42198102 L13.5299033,7.42198102 L13.1628515,10.2073892 L10.874068,10.2073892 L10.874068,17 L8.08865986,17 Z"></path></svg><span></span></button></div><div><button><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M13.303 10.7714L19.1223 4H17.7433L12.6904 9.87954L8.65471 4H4L10.1028 12.8909L4 19.9918H5.37906L10.715 13.7828L14.977 19.9918H19.6317L13.3027 10.7714H13.303ZM11.4142 12.9692L10.7958 12.0839L5.87595 5.03921H7.9941L11.9645 10.7245L12.5829 11.6098L17.7439 18.9998H15.6258L11.4142 12.9696V12.9692Z"></path></svg><span></span></button></div><div><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19"><path d="M17,17 L13.89343,17 L13.89343,12.1275733 C13.89343,10.9651251 13.87218,9.47069458 12.2781416,9.47069458 C10.660379,9.47069458 10.4126568,10.7365137 10.4126568,12.0434478 L10.4126568,17 L7.30623235,17 L7.30623235,6.98060885 L10.2883591,6.98060885 L10.2883591,8.3495072 L10.3296946,8.3495072 C10.7445056,7.56190587 11.7585364,6.7312941 13.2709225,6.7312941 C16.418828,6.7312941 17,8.80643844 17,11.5041407 L17,17 Z M3.80289931,5.61098151 C2.80647978,5.61098151 2,4.80165627 2,3.80498046 C2,2.80903365 2.80647978,2 3.80289931,2 C4.79669898,2 5.60434314,2.80903365 5.60434314,3.80498046 C5.60434314,4.80165627 4.79669898,5.61098151 3.80289931,5.61098151 Z M2.24786773,17 L2.24786773,6.98060885 L5.35662096,6.98060885 L5.35662096,17 L2.24786773,17 Z"></path></svg><span></span></button></div><div><div><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19"><path d="M10.6000004,11.7622375 L14.2108923,11.7622375 C15.4561791,11.7622